                  <div style="line-height:8.0pt;margin-top:225pt;text-align:left;">

                     <div style="margin-top:5pt;"><font style="color:#000000;font-family:Arial;font-size:7pt;font-weight:bold;">The Fund&#x2019;s statutory Prospectus and Statement of Additional Information dated April
                           28, 2026, as </font><font style="color:#000000;font-family:Arial;font-size:7pt;font-weight:bold;">may be amended or supplemented, are incorporated into and made part of this Summary
