                              </div>
                           </td>
                        </tr>
                     </table>
                  </div>

                  <div style="line-height:10.5pt;margin-top:18pt;text-align:left;">

                     <div style="margin-top:18pt;"><font style="color:#000000;font-family:Arial;font-size:8.5pt;font-weight:bold;">Annual Fund Operating Expenses</font>
                        <br /><font style="color:#000000;font-family:Arial;font-size:8.5pt;">(Expenses that you pay each year as a percentage of the value of your investment)</font><font style="color:#000000;font-family:Arial;font-size:1pt;line-height:1pt;">&#x2003;</font></div>
                  </div>

                  <div style="line-height:1.0pt;margin-top:6pt;text-align:left;">

                     <div style="margin-top:6pt;"> </div>
                  </div>

                  <div style="margin-top:0.0pt;">

                     <table style="border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;empty-cells:show;width:336pt;" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">

                        <tr style="height:12.5pt;">

                           <td style="background-color:#FFFFFF;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;vertical-align:Bottom;width:336pt;" colspan="2">

                              <div style="line-height:0.5pt;text-align:left;">

                                 <div style="margin-right:-2pt;text-align:Left;white-space:nowrap;"><font style="color:#000000;font-family:Arial;font-size:8pt;font-weight:bold;margin-left:0.0pt;">&nbsp;</font></div>
                              </div>
