                  <div style="line-height:11.5pt;margin-top:12pt;text-align:left;">

                     <div style="margin-top:12pt;"><font style="color:#000000;font-family:Arial;font-size:9.5pt;">Example</font></div>
                  </div>

                  <div style="line-height:11.5pt;margin-top:8.0pt;text-align:left;">

                     <div style="margin-top:8pt;"><font style="color:#000000;font-family:Arial;font-size:9.5pt;">This example is intended to help you compare the cost of investing in the Fund </font><font style="color:#000000;font-family:Arial;font-size:9.5pt;">with the cost of investing in other funds. The example assumes that you invest </font><font style="color:#000000;font-family:Arial;font-size:9.5pt;">$10,000 in the Fund for the time periods indicated and then redeem all of your </font><font style="color:#000000;font-family:Arial;font-size:9.5pt;">shares at the end of those periods. The example also assumes that your </font><font style="color:#000000;font-family:Arial;font-size:9.5pt;">investment has a 5% return each year and that the Fund&#x2019;s operating expenses </font><font style="color:#000000;font-family:Arial;font-size:9.5pt;">remain the same.</font><font style="color:#000000;font-family:Arial;font-size:1pt;line-height:1pt;">&#x2003;</font></div>
                  </div>

                  <div style="margin-top:0.0pt;">

                     <table style="border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;empty-cells:show;width:336pt;" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">

